      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise Dr. Konishi, Dr. Itescu, Dr. R, and the support staff for warmth, patience, and dedication. Clients emphasize that the doctors listen attentively to concerns and never rush consultations. Even after transitions in clinic ownership, long-term clients report high trust in the veterinary staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle care for anxious companion pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly note the team's gentle touch with squirmy cats, high-strung puppies, and nervous rescue dogs. Staff members like Melissa and Cheyenne receive special praise for keeping animals calm during vaccinations, blood draws, and dental work. Owners appreciate seeing pets treated with genuine affection."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Transparent estimates and thorough medical explanations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight clear communication regarding treatment options, printed instructions, and post-visit follow-up calls. Reviewers appreciate that the clinic provides honest cost estimates and respects owner budgets. Pet parents value receiving transparent explanations before procedures or surgeries proceed."
      }
    }
